/**
 * Tutorial Selector Registry
 *
 * Single source of truth for all `data-tour` attribute keys used across
 * the Kleegr mock GHL platform.
 *
 * Rules:
 * - Keys follow the pattern `area.element` (lowercase area, camelCase element).
 * - Module agents add `data-tour={key}` to their JSX using the exact key
 *   strings exported here. They do NOT edit this file unless assigned.
 * - The Tutorial engine uses these keys to locate DOM elements; never
 *   use nth-child, class names, or generated IDs as tutorial targets.
 *
 * This file must have zero external dependencies.
 */

